00:03:01.740 --> 00:03:03.780
Explain yourself.

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:07.660
Believe it or not, I ran into a drowning girl...

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:11.080
I'm asking about your outfit!

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:15.090
Well, my clothes were all gone by the time I got back to the beach!

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:17.670
But don't worry, Ms. Machiko!

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:19.590
I have my usual...

00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:20.630
{kore ga}Jersey!

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:22.180
Ta-da!

00:03:22.930 --> 00:03:26.430
Then put it on, damn it!

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:27.600
Okay!

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:29.270
Kyouno.

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:32.980
The fire department called earlier.

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:37.070
That girl you rescued regained consciousness.

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:40.110
Success!{not sure what to put here yet}

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:43.610
Madoka.

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:47.450
I know it's a bit sudden, but can you help us out after school?

00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:49.450
Sure, what time?

00:03:49.450 --> 00:03:50.710
Whenever you're free.

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:54.880
Our captain insists that it has to be you.

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:56.000
Thanks!

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:01.590
You're gonna spar with the Student Council's president again?

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:04.590
The Jersey Club is busy as ever, huh?

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:06.010
Would you like to join, too?

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:07.640
{buin mo}We're recruiting.

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:11.140
I'll pass.

00:04:11.140 --> 00:04:14.940
By the way, I thought you were going to wear uniform to school today.

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:18.730
Yeah, but I lost it on the way here.

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:20.650
You're hopeless.

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:23.150
Wh-What?

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:26.200
I totally forgot...

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:31.450
{honki}Are you serious?

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:34.620
We're still in high school...

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:42.300
I can't answer to something that far ahead in the future!

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:44.840
{BG tape wo}Changing tapes.

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:46.340
Was that okay?

00:04:46.340 --> 00:04:47.390
It was awesome!

00:04:47.390 --> 00:04:48.720
{chou kawaii}You were so cute!

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:51.470
I like seeing you in uniform,

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:53.230
but this is charming in its own way!

00:04:53.230 --> 00:04:55.140
Uh, sorry.

00:04:55.140 --> 00:04:56.350
{jitsu wa}Actually, this is for...

00:05:01.030 --> 00:05:02.860
One more!

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:07.740
Head!{missing line}

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:09.070
Head strike!

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:14.540
I admit defeat.

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:17.120
Thanks for giving me a good practice before the tournament.

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:22.590
If you'd only take over the Student Council or the Kendo club for me,

00:05:22.590 --> 00:05:24.840
{TLC}I could graduate with a resounding <i>success</i>.{waiting on a good word for maru}

00:05:25.470 --> 00:05:27.720
I already lead a club, you know.

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:29.930
That's true.

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:33.270
I'm looking forward to your third straight title.

00:05:51.990 --> 00:05:52.950
How about crepes?

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:53.660
Good idea!

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:58.620
Kyouno Madoka.

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:02.550
Yes?

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:29.410
You dropped this.

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:33.530
What's with that girl?

00:06:33.530 --> 00:06:35.450
Did the Jersey Club finally recruit someone?

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:36.540
No way.

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:38.290
She's so brave!

00:06:38.290 --> 00:06:40.540
That takes a lot of courage.

00:06:44.130 --> 00:06:45.000
Thank you...

00:06:57.270 --> 00:06:58.640
She's a comrade!

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:20.830
I'm home!

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:23.380
Youko!

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:25.630
Welcome back.

00:07:25.630 --> 00:07:27.000
Thanks!

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:28.670
What's up?

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:30.340
{hantoshi}I haven't seen you in half a year!

00:07:33.140 --> 00:07:34.890
Ow!

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:38.470
{tappu}I give up.

00:07:38.470 --> 00:07:38.930
I give up.

00:07:38.930 --> 00:07:39.770
I give up!

00:07:40.310 --> 00:07:41.640
That's pathetic.

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:43.690
Aren't you in high school now?

00:07:43.690 --> 00:07:47.570
Wh-What does that have to do with anything?

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:49.190
We need to talk.

00:07:49.190 --> 00:07:50.070
Huh?

00:07:58.540 --> 00:07:59.750
Take off your panties.

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:01.870
What?

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:07.250
Don't move.

00:08:10.800 --> 00:08:12.510
Um... geez.

00:08:19.810 --> 00:08:21.180
Madoka.

00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:22.850
Do you like Kamogawa?

00:08:22.850 --> 00:08:25.600
What's this about?

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:27.480
Do you intend to live here for the rest of your life?

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:29.610
Yeah, why do you ask?

00:08:32.110 --> 00:08:33.650
Souta Serizawa

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:35.950
Yes.

00:08:36.570 --> 00:08:37.370
Understood.

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:45.920
Call me immediately if something comes up.

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:52.970
Tokyo Maritime University Marine Archaeology Research Institute

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:52.970
Researcher

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:52.970
Youko Nakaizumi

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:06.560
Success!

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:28.330
You scared the bejesus out of me!

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:29.420
Were you there the whole time?

00:09:30.790 --> 00:09:31.670
Woof.

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:39.390
Thanks for waiting!

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:45.270
Jersey Club

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:45.270
Contact Madoka Kyouno in Class 2-3

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:45.270
A

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:45.270
Members always welcome!!

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:45.270
We'll help you with anything!!

00:09:42.390 --> 00:09:44.810
Do you wanna join?

00:09:44.810 --> 00:09:45.270
Yes.

00:09:45.270 --> 00:09:46.940
I knew it!

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:49.150
Let's do this.

00:09:50.860 --> 00:09:55.320
I knew since yesterday's encounter that we'd get along!

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:58.570
You were kind enough to return my uniform in person!

00:09:58.570 --> 00:10:02.530
And that swimsuit shows you're always on standby for a rescue operation!

00:10:02.530 --> 00:10:03.990
It's my uniform.

00:10:03.990 --> 00:10:05.410
Your uniform?

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:08.370
I'm obligated to wear it while on duty.

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:10.710
Such passion!

00:10:10.710 --> 00:10:15.010
I was thinking of calling you a comrade, but maybe you're my senior?

00:10:15.010 --> 00:10:16.090
What's a comrade?

00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:21.890
A colleague who walks the same path and shares the same ideals.

00:10:21.890 --> 00:10:24.100
But I guess it's out of fashion.

00:10:24.100 --> 00:10:28.100
My cousin likes using strange words. I picked it up from her.

00:10:28.100 --> 00:10:29.600
That's a nice word.

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:31.610
Comrade.

00:10:32.060 --> 00:10:33.940
Wanna become my comrade?

00:10:33.940 --> 00:10:37.490
I'll back you up 100% if you ever need any help!

00:10:38.780 --> 00:10:40.030
{sore wa}Good idea.

00:10:40.030 --> 00:10:42.570
Comrades, then.

00:10:42.570 --> 00:10:45.120
I'm Fin E Ld Si Laffinty.

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:46.370
Is that your name?

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:48.000
It sounds foreign!

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:50.170
Just call me Lan.

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:51.920
I'm Kyouno Madoka.

00:10:51.920 --> 00:10:52.670
Nice to meet you!

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:54.380
Yay!

00:10:54.380 --> 00:10:56.420
{futari ni}The club's now two members strong!

00:10:56.420 --> 00:10:58.220
Let's get down to business, Comrade.

00:10:58.220 --> 00:11:00.470
I need your help.

00:11:00.470 --> 00:11:01.470
What is it?

00:11:01.470 --> 00:11:02.930
I'll help you out with anything!

00:11:03.350 --> 00:11:06.180
Can you ride a robot?

00:11:26.030 --> 00:11:28.200
That's the Earth...

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:29.330
There's no mistake about it.

00:11:30.120 --> 00:11:36.340
Our destination, the blue planet that shines brighter than even De Metrio.

00:11:36.340 --> 00:11:39.090
Then there's only one thing left to do.

00:11:39.090 --> 00:11:40.260
Let's go.

00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:40.840
Wait.

00:11:41.340 --> 00:11:44.220
Le Garite's forces might be near.

00:11:44.850 --> 00:11:47.470
Put the Ovid on standby.

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:51.440
Tsk, fine.

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:53.440
Come with me, Array.

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:57.230
Who died and made you king, Kirius?

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:11.120
Does that look like a planet that already died once?

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:12.330
Yurikano?

00:12:12.660 --> 00:12:13.210
What?

00:12:14.210 --> 00:12:14.790
What?

00:12:15.250 --> 00:12:17.290
What?!

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:32.640
I had no idea there was something like this off the coast.

00:12:32.640 --> 00:12:34.060
It traveled here.

00:12:34.060 --> 00:12:34.980
Traveled?!

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:36.190
It's a ship?

00:12:36.190 --> 00:12:37.060
Come this way.

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:38.820
Madoka.

00:12:38.820 --> 00:12:39.940
I'm coming in.

00:12:43.990 --> 00:12:45.570
Dad!

00:12:45.570 --> 00:12:46.950
Where's Madoka?

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:50.290
She came home earlier.

00:12:58.840 --> 00:13:00.880
Don't worry, Auntie.

00:13:01.460 --> 00:13:05.630
I won't let Madoka pilot stupid robots.

00:13:10.010 --> 00:13:10.640
Yes?

00:13:10.060 --> 00:13:10.640
{missing line}

00:13:10.640 --> 00:13:12.100
Where are you?

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:17.350
Your cousin is here.

00:13:20.320 --> 00:13:21.650
Damn it!

00:13:42.550 --> 00:13:45.050
Is that the robot?

00:13:45.050 --> 00:13:46.050
Yes.

00:13:46.050 --> 00:13:48.050
I thought it'd be...

00:13:48.050 --> 00:13:49.470
{motto konna}more like this.

00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:55.350
It's pretty, though.

00:13:56.100 --> 00:13:57.020
{"are" only}Huh?

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:13.740
Have I seen this somewhere before?

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:37.850
What just happened?

00:14:42.980 --> 00:14:44.020
De Metrio.

00:14:57.700 --> 00:14:59.040
First enemy unit sighted.

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:01.210
Off the port side. Distance: 7 klicks.

00:15:01.210 --> 00:15:02.500
All ships, prepare to intercept.

00:15:16.100 --> 00:15:16.680
Fire!

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:38.750
You must have made a promise with this craft in the past.

00:15:40.660 --> 00:15:44.040
That you two would entrust your souls at all times.

00:15:44.750 --> 00:15:45.840
That you would become comrades.

00:15:47.800 --> 00:15:48.800
A comrade...

00:15:50.090 --> 00:15:51.260
{kore ga}of mine.

00:15:52.380 --> 00:15:57.310
Our enemies believe this craft possesses tremendous power.

00:15:58.350 --> 00:15:59.270
Lan.

00:16:00.180 --> 00:16:01.810
Just who are you?

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:07.570
I have been ordered by Le Garite to protect you and the robot.

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:09.320
{uchuujin yo}I'm an alien.

00:16:09.990 --> 00:16:11.900
An alien?

00:16:11.900 --> 00:16:13.110
You mean like...

00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:15.660
"We come in peace—"

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:16.580
Yes.

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:28.000
Keep on firing.

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:30.760
Don't stop until this butler tells you to.

00:16:35.010 --> 00:16:38.560
Don't tell me it's you, Izo...

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:39.930
What's wrong?

00:16:39.930 --> 00:16:40.640
Izo?

00:16:40.680 --> 00:16:42.480
That means it's...

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:44.230
Array.

00:16:48.980 --> 00:16:50.150
I can't pilot it.

00:16:50.150 --> 00:16:51.150
Why not?

00:16:51.150 --> 00:16:54.450
I only know how to ride a bike.

00:16:54.450 --> 00:16:57.030
We'll control everything.

00:16:57.030 --> 00:16:59.410
You just sit in the cockpit.

00:16:59.740 --> 00:17:00.660
That's all?

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:01.910
That's all.

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:30.690
You would be in trouble if I didn't ride it.

00:17:31.270 --> 00:17:32.440
I would be.

00:17:41.910 --> 00:17:44.290
When did you come to Kamogawa?

00:17:45.620 --> 00:17:46.540
Yesterday.

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:51.130
So you don't know just how great this place is yet!

00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:53.880
Right...

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:58.890
There's only one answer then!

00:18:16.990 --> 00:18:18.570
Don't tell me that was...

00:18:23.240 --> 00:18:26.080
Wh-What is that?

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:27.250
Where's Madoka?

00:18:28.040 --> 00:18:29.170
Souta!

00:18:29.580 --> 00:18:31.590
She boarded the craft that just took off.

00:18:37.380 --> 00:18:39.090
How is the pilot?

00:18:39.090 --> 00:18:41.550
She seems to be very agitated.

00:18:42.470 --> 00:18:44.180
Should I put her on speakers?

00:18:44.430 --> 00:18:46.980
No, don't.

00:18:46.980 --> 00:18:49.940
Everything is under our control.

00:18:49.940 --> 00:18:53.190
Just tell her to not panic no matter what happens.

00:18:54.020 --> 00:18:55.690
Unlike a certain someone...

00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:05.370
It's coming straight at us!

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:06.240
Madoka!

00:19:11.120 --> 00:19:11.710
It didn't work.

00:19:14.540 --> 00:19:16.210
It all begins now.

00:19:17.800 --> 00:19:18.720
Yes.

00:19:22.590 --> 00:19:26.140
Uh, excuse me?!

00:19:26.140 --> 00:19:28.560
Something crazy is happening.

00:19:28.560 --> 00:19:30.600
{itetete}Ouch...

00:19:30.600 --> 00:19:32.440
Someone?

00:19:33.940 --> 00:19:35.020
No way!

00:19:38.990 --> 00:19:42.160
If only I could pilot it manually...

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:45.580
{19:53~4}What?!

00:20:19.480 --> 00:20:21.320
What's with this weird sensation?

00:20:21.320 --> 00:20:23.110
It feels nasty!

00:20:23.990 --> 00:20:25.120
Huh? What?

00:20:46.970 --> 00:20:49.720
She destroyed the Subspace Field?

00:20:49.720 --> 00:20:51.220
{are wa}Could that be...

00:20:51.220 --> 00:20:52.680
{densetsu no}the legendary...?!

00:21:01.280 --> 00:21:02.240
Vox!

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:17.630
Kendo ain't bad, but...

00:21:25.930 --> 00:21:28.090
Let's try some wrestling now!

00:21:43.490 --> 00:21:44.240
One,

00:21:44.820 --> 00:21:45.530
two,

00:21:46.240 --> 00:21:46.910
